  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fee85885dd8368d6bfdcd0c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年的『有马纪念』\n将是比萨胜驹的最后一战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65a7c8676a3ddac0c8769974dca7b2fba4eff8c7e44c42ce2fd07efb4ea2e894",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c66e13a5209563fb2ce5d84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "玫瑰帝国",
      "source_fingerprint": "16f8294da3f771718773578b0aa159a7f5a4d1cfb1c1e2b8ab6185f84b75b983",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18f6226c29283b6c9b8c6e3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "引退吗。\n……要变得寂寞了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6e0ca15d9abb5f47944dd2285c246603dbaa1fe16f170062486a5cc047b4e3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b85c515ba6b443a4d8b734b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比萨胜驹如此自然地\n逐渐被人们遗忘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5a78214f2c789a14027e777133222da5fe51aa7e5e2d173724c61f586ed3f30",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3ff2f4fe1883e79c271a1c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "他们将笑容与期待投向了新的希望。\n这一现状――",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b21b50df83e83d45aeff86aff10720929ebb2ed23ed3c3b2113ff27eb4de189",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f20cea395f42a83f416f220",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仿佛那一天她在迪拜的身影正在消逝，\n令我无论如何也无法接受。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c0bca9f388b7abf6c93292f0d47854239add7e8e047ff3068f20028b35bb198",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:435e0e002daa098fcd194488",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在这样的某一天，\n我在店里发现了一盏提灯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "13997fb9071a45f1b2557610dad500a36b80f49c9d8f4ce900f09179f2efee83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96fee32cb21e0ba858f670e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比萨胜驹",
      "source_fingerprint": "9beb50d57d7703a64ba6e9d70094d69e3edf1f53654ce1b6055f0ddd7c2b63d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:484039365efe2b18bd666c90",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在晚上，我想把它放在窗外。\n因为最近闪耀同学总是训练到很晚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e99a8aa00429d80416655aad69015dd8290b95ed633b00f2837cd3f817f1b09c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db061ad98c2f6603efe52d2a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比萨胜驹",
      "source_fingerprint": "9beb50d57d7703a64ba6e9d70094d69e3edf1f53654ce1b6055f0ddd7c2b63d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ccb451f1fec62fe9526eab6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近门禁时的宿舍挺暗的。\n虽然只是个心理安慰，\n但要是有点光亮，总能让她的心里踏实些吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d67289543bf1228fa3e52ffab836a0814ab5d805da8a1a047ed90d20c434375a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3210b557d56790462b9e8892",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5999fb8c439aedc310fc22e9b23faada72dc7422a48e55a6526491f7b19cc31",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bf4a7695142baf0de005aa6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是和那一天见到的，\n再普通不过的提灯一样的――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1516bcf4fc03358032bd282af97c2d25e373a25535b393b87cec6493c66afaf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ef3e15e4537e45e8b180b60",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "注意到的时候，我已经将它拿在了手里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2adf9888bd7827f1669f09d92a06f5a68fad362175d5d5a9e1cc53bcee04782f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14eb84ddc8c4ed0cbc987b82",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回到训练员室，我转动开关。\n伴随着清脆的声响，\n柔和的光线在房间里弥漫开来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aece31aab0ed84c36457529db370e1a738db3a27ad9b3d230b2fd89d69d7bc40",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5146bcc27fca4d2c95e649d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我把提灯放在窗边。\n灯光映照在玻璃上，\n并且微微地照亮了窗外的黑暗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78d676b7933db033a985851efc0666af617c2e37b8f53f93da3d6c4895fe8537",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cb49c82c36b125af65d77d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "统治地位",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec85cad9328ee0b111926357aac4c3a170b45eb8b28b57355bf49d22cf30ab46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccd3af4f33fce5642bb52a32",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本来还想着多少拦一下的，\n但看到你的表情――这不是完美通关了嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "baf0f62c3ea4f9573d3a6fad61a6194e8c6206e7a434e8195a63b4ba6d085086",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b30b5d95778cd4787959b369",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比萨胜驹每晚，\n都会在窗外放上一盏提灯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a288469a67bcc0f7296a6891baa7a133c4841518eb227d204e13a4a269c56c51",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28c7028933d8adec6a362862",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……我做这种事，有什么意义呢）",
      "source_fingerprint": "fabf302556bfbbd516e899a3a8f79e1420e773101ef5314d0db4bca2b416d84e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4eaf88004fba04879277b94",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使不知道是否会被注意到，\n但只要能让对方的内心略有慰藉……\n仅此而已的心意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "303620dd768c26e4d06f481d22a608970bb6aa2e23a6e0f8306cba2840fad8ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21662225fa5e074e57ee2b1a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是，我无论如何\n都想要留住她的一些什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a02790af95ed5457b244d315722d1e563b85ef33737f8afffe987c5daead6c24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c15f2b5d89e1d63b3416b62e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "把提灯放在窗边之后过了一段日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff7c406a6281fb7a84cd04d09201fbdd5bfcf370ee988f6d9e0ba36559eee6ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7c7ecbbe408e967078a9c4f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新人训练员A",
      "source_fingerprint": "e829f9d4dc056512054ee3af7d16ee643fea041192ab34f55f5b5f4bdc406a95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:284db5faabd7dd246cb066ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是什么呀？\n每天晚上都点着什么东西欸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4c2f2b3911101247a23cc95d0a8666aaa59c4ea88485ef842a39646481e941e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8b590c0336b284f1698a304",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊啊，那是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0b2d6e45d21a6f10141f145336a489bf7e152d5866da8961ef0863d1e32d901",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d9cdc592d71d43d6fdeda84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新人训练员A",
      "source_fingerprint": "e829f9d4dc056512054ee3af7d16ee643fea041192ab34f55f5b5f4bdc406a95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21a2859a6ca60f8a1d0f5776",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我负责的孩子好像挺在意的。\n放着不管的话好像会变成新的七大不可思议之一呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d6ba4e6e5a83de7374ee191f6e98af745d6bdf46ec0fc2872fbc4618faac977",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21e9efbbb9385feb00ee0a30",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是比萨胜驹的习惯，\n如此简单的解释，重复了好几次。",
